;. /prepare_action_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition prepare_action
  ;= Bind arguments to a retained declared action
    Bind selection to a captured declared control and arguments to one native record of text fields. Existing Goo input metadata supplies rich-text encoding. Preparation preserves receiver and publication guards. Rediscovery is explicit; preparation never invokes or refreshes a stale selection.

    ;@ /flow/input selection
    ;= selection

    ;@ /flow/input arguments
    ;= arguments

    ;@ /flow/step actions ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/prepare_action
    ;@ /flow/bind selection selection
    ;@ /flow/bind arguments arguments
    ;= actions

    ;@ /flow/result actions
    ;= Bind arguments to a retained declared action result
